{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is Bily'sine?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bily'Sine is an <strong>adventure game</strong> (2D, top view, pixel art) where you play as a <strong>human lost in a mysterious world</strong> populated by magicians forced to capture you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Explore</strong> the world of Bily'Sine, <strong>unlock its secrets</strong> and <strong>battle in magical duels</strong> to find your way <strong>back to the world of Humans</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>choices</strong> will shape your <strong>destiny</strong> and that of the world of Bily'Sine, so... what are you going to do?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run away?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save it?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or perhaps... destroy it?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A world to discover !</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bily'Sine is a magical world full of mystery, divided into 4 chapters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll meet some unique Hua characters through a series of dialogues with a choice of answers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The main story has several narrative paths depending on the actions you take during your adventure - it's up to you to find them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret stories can be unlocked if you're curious enough to explore every corner of Bily'Sine!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964680/extras/b4737e32a174a39ca2b7518563acd0b3.avif?t=1761755146\" width=1560 height=274 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic magic duels !</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO EXPERIENCE GAUGE, NO FARM, NO LEVEL!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absorb or dodge tons of magic projectiles, then attack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The duels are short but intense, so it's up to you to adapt: kill or neutralise your opponent!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964680/extras/786dca0df8655f67ed4c039b001f1785.avif?t=1761755146\" width=1560 height=259 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Save ? What do you means ?&quot;</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO POINT / SAVE FILE!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can load the game at any progress you like, as long as you've discovered the corresponding &quot;secret&quot;.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets are words that allow you to resume the game at a specific time (from the secrets menu).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964680/extras/d2bfec57666dac854be649136eb1bc41.avif?t=1761755146\" width=1560 height=261 /></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3964680?t=1761755146","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3964680?t=1761755146","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964680/a66b3afaf90e59ef8ccec3719d807c8a82df9ae7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761755146","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964680/a66b3afaf90e59ef8ccec3719d807c8a82df9ae7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761755146","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4069900,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is Bily'sine?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bily'Sine is an <strong>adventure game</strong> (2D, top view, pixel art) where you play as a <strong>human lost in a mysterious world</strong> populated by magicians forced to capture you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Explore</strong> the world of Bily'Sine, <strong>unlock its secrets</strong> and <strong>battle in magical duels</strong> to find your way <strong>back to the world of Humans</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>choices</strong> will shape your <strong>destiny</strong> and that of the world of Bily'Sine, so... what are you going to do?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run away?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save it?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or perhaps... destroy it?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A world to discover !</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bily'Sine is a magical world full of mystery, divided into 4 chapters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll meet some unique Hua characters through a series of dialogues with a choice of answers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The main story has several narrative paths depending on the actions you take during your adventure - it's up to you to find them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret stories can be unlocked if you're curious enough to explore every corner of Bily'Sine!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964680/extras/b4737e32a174a39ca2b7518563acd0b3.avif?t=1761755146\" width=1560 height=274 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic magic duels !</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO EXPERIENCE GAUGE, NO FARM, NO LEVEL!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absorb or dodge tons of magic projectiles, then attack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The duels are short but intense, so it's up to you to adapt: kill or neutralise your opponent!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964680/extras/786dca0df8655f67ed4c039b001f1785.avif?t=1761755146\" width=1560 height=259 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Save ? What do you means ?&quot;</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO POINT / SAVE FILE!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can load the game at any progress you like, as long as you've discovered the corresponding &quot;secret&quot;.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets are words that allow you to resume the game at a specific time (from the secrets menu).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964680/extras/d2bfec57666dac854be649136eb1bc41.avif?t=1761755146\" width=1560 height=261 /></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["Kazuma"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964680/9540ec7b4d7a8d2dad37a483af084e9e9def87d0/header.jpg?t=1761755146","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3964680/1470083217/2dd5a8b0772083dae6f779b4821134e574a09187/1755629240/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760133663","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3